# Fonts for server-side export (WeasyPrint), installed by backend/scripts/install-fonts.sh.
#
# The font picker offers families a Linux image does not have, and a missing
# family made WeasyPrint fall back to whatever it found, sometimes an uploaded
# display font. Families Debian packages are installed with apt (see the
# Dockerfiles); these come from Google Fonts, pinned to one commit and checked
# against their SHA-256, so a build gets exactly these bytes. All are under the
# SIL Open Font License, whose text is installed beside each family.
#
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/fonts/bd8f81ddb5c74d5c8897b36ad88b440266245103/ofl/
#
# family: EB Garamond
# family: Gelasio
# family: Libre Baskerville
# family: Libre Caslon Text
# family: Merriweather
# family: Lora
# family: Crimson Text
# family: Source Serif 4
# family: Literata
# family: Noto Serif
